Name: debug_jmap_atomic_failstep
Type: INT
Default-Value: 0
Last-Modified: UNRELEASED

If nonzero, the Nth failure point reached while applying an atomic JMAP
Foo/set method fails with an I/O error, so that the undo path runs.  The
count starts again at 1 for each method call.  0 disables the injection.
This is for regression tests only.
